## Third-party software

The addon's repository contains no third-party code, fonts or images. The built control panel files in `resources/dist` hold the addon's own code and the CSS that Tailwind CSS (MIT licence) generates from it; Vue and Statamic's components are loaded from Statamic, not bundled.

Composer installs these alongside it, each under its own licence:

- [Statamic](https://statamic.com/license) (`statamic/cms`), under the Statamic licence.
- [the-og](https://github.com/simonhamp/the-og) (`simonhamp/the-og`), which draws the share cards, under the MIT licence. It ships the Inter font (SIL Open Font License 1.1) and the Roboto Slab font (Apache License 2.0), and a few background images.
